From ca905e39d843a3bec7176bb9921b0edd424d184d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yuzu <yuzu23234@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 13:33:34 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] libcamera: sensor: add LG G8 sensor helpers and ancillary
 OIS/focus lens support

Register gain models and frame delays for S5K3M5, IMX363, IMX351, and
IMX520. Extend CameraLens with explicit open/close lifecycle and position
readback, and distinguish focus lenses from OIS subdevices when discovering
sensor ancillary entities.
---
 include/libcamera/internal/camera_lens.h      |  3 ++
 include/libcamera/internal/camera_sensor.h    |  1 +
 src/ipa/libipa/camera_sensor_helper.cpp       | 45 +++++++++++++++++
 src/libcamera/camera_lens.cpp                 | 34 +++++++++++++
 src/libcamera/sensor/camera_sensor_legacy.cpp | 37 +++++++++++---
 .../sensor/camera_sensor_properties.cpp       | 50 +++++++++++++++++++
 6 files changed, 163 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

